    "description": "Content-sweep priority queue for the WatchTheFall Instagram network. Each hourly run picks the account with the oldest last_successful_sweep (null = never swept, treated as infinitely overdue) and sweeps only that one account. status distinguishes an attempt from a success: last_attempted updates every run; last_successful_sweep only updates when the sweep actually completed and the library file was checked/updated. Accounts with status FAILED stay overdue automatically (their last_successful_sweep doesn't move), so they resurface at the top of the queue without any special-casing.",
